WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.300
Narrator: The first welcome. A family arrives, a little anxious.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:08.400
Narrator: Faisal holds out his hand for the tickets - no greeting, no smile.

3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.000
Faisal: Tickets?

4
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.200
Narrator: Let's try that again.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.400
Narrator: This time Faisal smiles, puts his hand on his heart, kneels to the girl's level and asks if it is her first match.

6
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.800
Girl: Yes!

7
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.200
Narrator: A greeting and a smile come before the ticket.

8
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.300
Narrator: Faisal turns a check into a welcome.

